<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 years. In 2025, November to December came in at 44% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 42% of normal there. On grid 19696, the driest year was 1988 at 67%.</p>"}
